00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,580
这张得撑到明年生日呢
that has to last till my next birthday,

172
00:08:36,860 --> 00:08:38,860
而且因为放太久 湿巾都干了大半了
and it's already lost a lot of its moisture.

173
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:43,400
我们为什么要呆坐在这里呢
I don't see why we have to just sit here.

174
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,800
我们不能开这车
We can't drive it.

175
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,360
我爸说 万一这车子出事了
My dad said if anything happens to it,

176
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,380
我们就得负责
we'll be responsible.

177
00:08:48,660 --> 00:08:50,020
哪能出什么事啊
What could possibly happen

178
00:08:50,020 --> 00:08:51,980
就去墨西哥边境城市进点大麻回来而已
on a weed run to deep Tijuana?

179
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:55,460
我真希望没收到过这台车
You know, I wish this car never came,

180
00:08:55,460 --> 00:08:56,980
也从没坐到这台车上过
and I wish I never sat in it.

181
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,340
就跟我现在不去百货公司一样
It's the same reason I don't go to Barneys.

182
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:00,940
我不想要靠近我买不起的事物
I don't like to be around things I can't afford anymore.

183
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:04,175
我也是因为这样才不去一元店的
Same reason I don't go to the 99 Cent Store.

184
00:09:04,175 --> 00:09:06,260
里面有一套玩具网球组
There's a Nerf tennis set

185
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:08,080
一半在地上 一半在垃圾桶里
half on the floor, half in the bin,

186
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,880
但是我还是只能空手而归
none of it going home with me.

187
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:14,280
我本来还试着用正面态度面对我今年生日
I was trying to be positive about my birthday this year,

188
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,680
但麦克斯 如果我爸爸没出事
but, Max, if things hadn't happened with my father,

189
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:19,240
今晚或许我真能过个魔力的生日
tonight would have been a magical birthday for me.

190
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,580
我也展现点魔力给你瞧瞧
Hey, there was some magic.

191
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:23,920
我把五杯伏特加混雪碧弄消失了
I personally made five vodka Sprites disappear.

192
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:25,520
厉害吧
Ta-da!

193
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:29,660
我会坐上车 开到汉普顿[度假胜地]
I would've got in the car and driven out to the Hamptons,

194
00:09:29,660 --> 00:09:31,520
我们可以整晚坐在海滩边
and we'd sit on the beach all night

195
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,540
让当地人抓龙虾给我们吃
having lobster caught by one of the townies

196
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:36,820
再一边喝红酒 一边拍个鸭嘴自拍
and drink champagne while taking duckface selfies

197
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:38,520
直到日出
till the sun came up.

198
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:44,220
在你整段剧情里 我是那个"当地人"
FYI, I'm the townie in this scenario,

199
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:45,340
我恨你们全部人
and I hate all of you.

200
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:49,180
但我不是在做那些事 而是在过最烂的生日
Instead of doing any of that, I'm having the worst birthday.

201
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:51,460
这感觉大概比黛米·摩尔
I probably feel worse than Demi Moore did

202
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:52,820
过50岁生日时还糟吧
when she turned 50.

203
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:56,080
你就乖乖睡吧
Yes, just go to sleep.

204
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:59,060
你明天醒了以后会开心点的
You'll feel better tomorrow when you wake up.

205
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,116
前提是那个手里拿着弹簧刀
I mean, if that guy with the switchblade

206
00:10:01,116 --> 00:10:04,815
说了会回来报仇的男人没有回来
doesn't come back like he promised he would.

207
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:11,220
卡洛琳
Caroline.

208
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:12,040
卡洛琳 醒醒
Caroline, wake up.

209
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:16,120
我们到海滩了
We're at the beach.

210
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:17,560
我开车把我们载到汉普顿啦
I drove us out to the Hamptons.

211
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,400
生日快乐
Happy birthday!

212
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:25,480
我们到汉普顿了
We're in the Hamptons?

213
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:29,220
我们居然到汉普顿了
We're in the Hamptons?

214
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,660
我们怎么会来到汉普顿
How are we in the Hamptons?

215
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,260
我到底睡了多久啊
How long have I been sleeping?

216
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:36,140
三个小时左右吧
Three hours, give or take.

217
00:10:36,300 --> 00:10:37,520
你还放了两个屁
You farted twice.

218
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:40,940
我怎么就没醒呢
How did I not wake up?

219
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:42,500
就是啊 味道超难闻
I know. It was pretty bad.

220
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:47,480
第二个屁让我误以为开车经过了臭鸡蛋镇呢
After that last one, I thought we were going through Egg Town.

221
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,580
麦克斯 你又来了
Max, you did it again.

222
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,280
你对我下药了 是吗
You roofied me, didn't you?

223
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:56,040
那是必须的呀
Of course I did.

224
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:59,020
你一边哭哭哭 一边叨叨叨汉普顿
You were crying and babbling about the Hamptons,

225
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:00,580
所以我必须把你迷晕呀
so I had to put you down.

226
00:11:01,940 --> 00:11:03,760
你答应过我不会再做这种事
You promised you wouldn't again.

227
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,720
上次你害我昏睡了整整两天
The last time, I was out for two days.

228
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:08,260
那是因为我真的很想好好看完《权利的游戏》
Yeah, I really just needed to get through Game of Thrones

229
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:11,160
而不是听某人在主角乱伦的时候讲道理
without someone talking during the incest.

230
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:16,040
你到底有什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you?

231
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,820
你有纸和笔可以记下来吗
Have you got a pen and paper?

232
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,160
你明知道我不想这么做
You knew I didn't want to do this.

233
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:24,480
你什么也不想做 所以我帮你做了
You never want to do anything, so I did it for you.

234
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:27,840
这辆车价值45万美元
You took a $450,000 car,

235
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:30,640
我们本来连碰都不该碰
a car we're not even supposed to be touching,

236
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:33,440
而你却开着它一路兜风来汉普顿
on a joyride to the Hamptons?

237
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,960
是你想来这里
You wanted to be here.

238
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,280
现在你来了
You are here.

239
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,460
好好享受吧
Just enjoy it.

240
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:42,340
我没心情享受
I can't enjoy it.

241
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,220
斯科蒂 到舰桥来
Scotty to the bridge.

242
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:46,340
我是柯克舰长
This is Captain Kirk.

243
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,460
斯科蒂 到舰桥来
Scotty to the bridge.

244
00:11:50,780 --> 00:11:54,800
你开车碾过沙丘 然后开到沙滩上来吗
You drove over the dunes and onto the beach?

245
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,880
我不是故意的
Not intentionally.

246
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,682
我本来想停下 但这辆车当时说
I tried to stop it, but this car was like,

247
00:11:59,682 --> 00:12:01,465
"姑娘 不许停"
"Mm, no, girl."

248
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,520
我的老天
Oh, my God.

249
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,600
那车身上有没有划痕
Did it get any scratches?

250
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,940
麦克斯 快下车 帮我看看有没有划痕
Max, get out of the car, and help me look for scratches.

251
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:14,080
亏你还说你在汉普顿会变得更有趣
You said you were more fun in the Hamptons.

252
00:12:15,780 --> 00:12:16,900
都是假的
Not true.

253
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,760
苏鲁先生 发射所有光炮[星际迷航]
Mr. Sulu, fire all phasers.

254
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:25,720
没有划痕 兰博基尼完好无损
No scratches. The Lamborghini is fine.

255
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:28,560
但多亏了你 现在我成了美而廉租车公司了
But thanks to you, I'm a Rent-A-Wreck.

256
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:34,020
走吧 我们得把车弄回去
Come on, we have to get this car back.

257
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:36,100
会弄回去的 你放心吧
We will. Jeez, relax.

258
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:37,080
我们还有时间
We still have time.

259
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:39,380
听着 你说你想来这里
Look, you said you wanted to be here.

260
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:41,139
现在你来了 而且我们不会轻易离开
You're here, and we are not leaving

261
00:12:41,139 --> 00:12:42,680
除非你做一些在海滩上会做的事
till you do something beach-y,

262
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,400
比如走到海里
like walk in the water

263
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,960
或发现《大白鲨》里被吃了一半的女尸
or find a half-eaten lady from Jaws.

264
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,280
不 不行 还是走吧
No. No way. Let's go.

265
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,600
快把你的鞋子脱下
Just take off your shoes or something.

266
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:53,060
不要
No.

267
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,720
快脱下鞋子 感受下沙子
Just take off your shoes and feel the sand.

268
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,260
麦克斯 麦克斯 住手
Max! Max, stop.

269
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:58,680
自从贾斯汀·汀布莱克
I haven't had a proper pedicure

270
00:12:58,680 --> 00:13:00,420
上次发布单曲后 我就没做过美足护理了
since Justin Timberlake released a single.

271
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:03,500
快 动动你的脚
There. Now move your foot around.

272
00:13:04,940 --> 00:13:05,460
不要
No.

273
00:13:05,617 --> 00:13:06,393
不 不 不
No. No! No.

274
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:09,460
哇哦 感觉真好
Oh, yeah. That feels nice.

275
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,100
冰凉的沙子在我的脚趾间
The cold sand between my toes.

276
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:14,000
但麦克斯 不许看
But, Max, don't look.

277
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,440
中间那个脚趾很恐怖
That middle nail's a horror show.

278
00:13:16,580 --> 00:13:17,280
晚了
Too late.

279
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:19,200
我刚有一瞬间以为是裂开的开心果呢
I thought it was a pistachio for a second.

280
00:13:21,740 --> 00:13:24,180
麦克斯 你有多喜欢海滩呀
Max, how much do you love the beach?

281
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:25,940
不知道 我从来没去过
I don't know. I've never been to one.

282
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,480
你从来没来过海滩
You've never been to a beach?

283
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:30,080
没 来干嘛啊
No. What's the point?

284
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:31,440
我又没有挖宝金属探测器
I don't own a metal detector.

285
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,240
好啦 时间到
Well, time's up.

286
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:38,440
但我们才刚坐下
But we just sat down.

287
00:13:38,620 --> 00:13:40,260
我知道 但如果我们现在走
I know, but if we leave right now,

288
00:13:40,260 --> 00:13:41,780
就还有时间从麦当劳的
we'll still have enough time to

289
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:43,120
得来速车道呼啸而过
blow through a McDonald's drive-through

290
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:45,080
就像《回到未来》里的一样
like something from Back to the Future.

291
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,680
好吧 我打算在沙子上写下咱俩的名字
Well, I'm gonna write our names in the sand

292
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,500
因为我很喜欢你今天做的事
'cause it was a really nice thing

293
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:52,060
对我下药 绑架我
for you to drug me, kidnap me,

294
00:13:52,060 --> 00:13:53,900
偷了我的车 把我带来这
and steal my car to get me out here.

295
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,020
别客气 朋友嘛
Hey, we're friends.

296
00:13:58,660 --> 00:14:00,380
好啦 我先把这车掉个头
All right, I'll just turn this baby around.

297
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,260
糟糕
Uh-oh.

298
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:08,580
"糟糕"什么
What's "Uh-oh"?

299
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,620
什么"糟糕"了
What is "Uh-oh"?

300
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:14,800
车子陷进沙子里出不来了吗
Are we stuck in the sand?

301
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:18,160
你完全正确地解读了"糟糕"的意思
You have correctly identified the meaning of "Uh-oh."

302
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:22,240
我真喜欢我们无需完整的句子
I love that we don't need full sentences

303
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,440
就能相互交流的感觉
to communicate anymore.

304
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,280
再试
Try it again.

305
00:14:36,217 --> 00:14:37,240
还是不行
Nope.

306
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:39,660
跟运动员"狂欢"后 回家都没这么"辛苦"
I've had less trouble getting out of athlete's apartments.

307
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,580
你给我下去推车
Well, you're gonna have to get out and push.

308
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,140
为什么非得让我推
Why do I have to push?

309
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:47,320
谁让你对我下药 绑架我
Because you're the one who drugged me, kidnapped me,

310
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,440
还偷了我的车
and stole my car.

311
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:49,360
是是是
Exactly.

312
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:51,780
大部分活儿都被我承包了
I've already done the lion's share of the work.

313
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,940
而且这是我们的车
And it's our car.

314
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:56,660
好吧 去就去
Fine, I'll do it.

315
00:14:58,848 --> 00:15:01,232
门开了 乌乎拉中尉[星际迷航]
Door's up, Lieutenant Uhura.

316
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,680
现在这情况一点都不好笑好吗
It stopped being funny when we got stuck.

317
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,220
老天 别担心嘛
God, don't worry.

318
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:09,100
我曾用自己的双手把一个272公斤的女人
I got a 600-pound woman out of a booth

319
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:11,520
从卡座里拽出来 我没在怕的
at the diner with my bare hands. I'm fearless.

320
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:14,540
挂空挡 像我当时对那女的做的一样
Toss her in neutral like I did with that lady.

321
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:18,320
沙子和高跟鞋 这组合太销魂了
Sand and heels. Not a good combo.

322
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:20,738
销魂 销魂 超级销魂
Not a good combo. Not a good combo.

323
00:15:20,738 --> 00:15:23,064
好了
Oh, all right.

324
00:15:23,064 --> 00:15:24,785
好了
All right.

325
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,380
我要加速了
I'm gonna floor it.

326
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:29,120
从一数到三
On the count of three.

327
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,700
一 二
One, two...

328
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,880
"我太兴奋 过早了"
I got excited. I went early.

329
00:15:44,155 --> 00:15:47,140
如果每次听到这句话都存一毛钱
If I had a dime for every time I heard that,

330
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,326
老娘都可以买下这辆车了
I could buy this car.

331
00:15:48,326 --> 00:15:51,720
好啦 再试一遍
All right, let's try again.

332
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,680
一 二
One, two...

333
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,880
妈的 这次是故意的吧
Okay, that was on purpose.

334
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:11,300
有那么一点儿吧
A little bit.

335
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:13,740
我真不敢相信
I can't believe it.

336
00:16:13,900 --> 00:16:15,840
我真不敢相信我不敢相信此情此景
I can't believe that I can't believe it,

337
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,860
但我真的不敢相信
but I really can't believe it.

338
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:19,700
我们闯大祸了
We are in very big trouble,

339
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,620
而且还不是身处汉普顿好的那一边
and we're not even in the good Hamptons.

340
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:25,220
我只不过是想做件好事而已
I was trying to do something nice.

341
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:27,840
第一次 也是最后一次
First time, last time.

342
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,340
你知道你是什么吗
You know what you are?

343
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:31,980
你是鲁莽女
You are reckless.

344
00:16:32,660 --> 00:16:34,260
一直以来
You know, all this time,

345
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:36,520
我以为你是一个要么冲要么死的女汉子
I thought you were a ride-or-die kind of bitch.

346
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:40,520
我就是一个要么冲要么死的女汉子
I am a ride-or-die kind of bitch.

347
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,240
什么是"要么冲要么死的女汉子"
What's a ride-or-die kind of bitch?

348
00:16:46,605 --> 00:16:49,845
你是要上网搜吗
Are you Googling "Ride-or-die kind of bitch"?

349
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:53,180
我也想 但我手机信号不好
I would be, but I only have two bars.

350
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,760
听着 我们有两个选择
Look, we have two options:

351
00:16:58,180 --> 00:17:01,860
要么把车开出沙滩 要么让海浪把我们带走
Get the car out of the sand, or let the tide take us.

352
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:03,920
海浪带走这主意可以考虑
Put a pin in that tide thing,

353
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:05,340
这主意听起来不错
'cause I like the sound of it.

354
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:08,360
我们把车开回市里的时间都很紧绷了
We barely have enough time to get this car back to the city,

355
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:10,160
开不回去就要还45万
or we owe $450,000.

356
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:14,540
而我只有3美元 而且其中2美元还是硬币
And I only have $3, and 2 of it's in nickels.

357
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:17,080
现在快上车
Now get in the car.

358
00:17:17,420 --> 00:17:18,740
你居然藏有硬币
You're hoarding nickels,

359
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:21,360
而我去一元店却因为没钱空手而归
and I'm walking out of the 99 Cent Store empty-handed?

360
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,560
现在老娘气大了
Now I'm mad.

361
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:26,900
准备
Get ready.

362
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,760
你在干什么啊
What are you doing?

363
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:31,100
我要把车推出去
I'm pushing us out of here.

364
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:35,260
因为我是一个要么冲要么死的女汉子
Because I'm a ride-or-die kind of bitch!

365
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:37,920
应该是吧
I think.

366
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,420
现在快踩油门
Now hit it!

367
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:54,219
你做了什么 用屁把我们嘣出来了吗
What'd you do? Fart us out of the ditch?

368
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,820
说真的 卡洛琳 踩油门啊
Seriously, Caroline, step on it.

369
00:17:59,040 --> 00:17:59,980
不行 麦克斯
No, Max.

370
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:01,800
我们不能冒着出车祸的危险开快车
We can't risk getting into an accident.

371
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,580
万一没死怎么办
What if it's not fatal?

372
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:08,480
慢慢开兰博基尼就像去连锁海鲜餐厅
Driving a Lamborghini slow is like going to Red Lobster

373
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:10,200
却没有点他们的招牌菜切达湾软饼
and not getting the Cheddar Bay biscuits.

374
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,600
拜托 趁现在能还开我们就尽情享受嘛
Come on, we got to enjoy this car while we can.

375
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,760
-踩油门 -好啦
- Hit the gas. - All right.

376
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:17,440
我就踩到我能接受约会对象年龄的最大值
I'll take it up to the top of my age dating window.

377
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,880
那我来踩到我的最大值
And I'll take it to the top of mine.

378
00:18:22,244 --> 00:18:23,700
放手 好好玩嘛
Let go. Have some fun.

379
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:24,720
不 别压我的脚
No, don't push on my leg!

380
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:25,580
别压我的脚
Don't push on my--

381
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,880
太棒了
Yes! Yes!

382
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,420
史上最棒的生日
Best birthday ever!

383
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:34,100
我们要学《末路狂花》那样吗
Should we Thelma and Louise it?

384
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:35,820
你是说飞越悬崖吗
You mean drive over a cliff?

385
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,920
不 我是说戴上墨镜手拉手
No, I mean wear sunglasses and hold hands.

386
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,380
她们飞越了悬崖吗
They drive over a cliff?

387
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,100
我一直没有看完那部电影
I never saw the end.

388
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:53,800
她们回来了
There they are.

389
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,220
你们俩早上有按时把车还回去吗
Did you girls get the car back in time this morning?

390
00:18:56,580 --> 00:18:58,760
有 时间刚刚好 多亏了卡洛琳
Yep, just in time, thanks to Caroline.

391
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,660
她完全无视限速的标志
She was ignoring speed limit signs

392
00:19:00,660 --> 00:19:02,220
就像她无视流浪汉一样
like she does homeless people.

393
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:05,660
有个州警用四个字形容我开车
A state trooper called my driving

394
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:06,960
"刑事过失"
criminally negligent.

395
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,567
我真为你骄傲
I was so proud.

396
00:19:09,567 --> 00:19:11,660
我甚至可能有点过于激动
I might've even gotten emotional,

397
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:13,160
但我必须巧舌如簧求警察别开罚单
but I had to talk our way out of the ticket,

398
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,460
而且我必须在脱掉衣服时保持专业
and I like to be professional when my shirt's off.

399
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,660
你们没被开罚单吗
You didn't get a ticket?

400
00:19:19,020 --> 00:19:21,860
昨天我就因为走进全食超市而被捕了
Yesterday, I got arrested for just walking into Whole Foods.

401
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:25,420
真不敢相信我头发里还有沙子
I can't believe I still have sand in my hair.

402
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:28,000
如果你唯一有沙子的地方是你的头发
If the only place you still have sand is in your hair,

403
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:28,540
那恭喜你
you're lucky.

404
00:19:29,260 --> 00:19:31,160
沙多到我底下的"蚌"都要生珍珠了
I'm about to make a pearl down there.

405
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:36,820
哎哟 那不是穷鬼芭比吗
Oh, hey, there, destitute Barbie.

406
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:40,880
真可惜你的爱车没了
Sorry you lost the dream car.

407
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:42,120
我去我的卡座啦
Anyway, I'll be in my booth.

408
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:46,680
苏菲 漂亮的宝贝
Sophie, beautiful baby...

409
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:52,560
我已经把我的求婚地点缩小到三个范围了
I've narrowed down the site of my proposal to three options:

410
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,700
一 我们初次相遇的地方
A, the place we met...

411
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:57,720
二 我们最常做爱的地方
B, the place we've had sex most often...

412
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:02,000
三 我们最近一次做爱的地方
or C, the place we've had sex most recently.

413
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:06,200
且慢 且慢
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

414
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:10,360
这三个地方都是这个卡座
All three of those places are this booth!

415
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:14,540
那就对了
That's right.

416
00:20:15,192 --> 00:20:17,860
苏菲·科臣斯基
Sophie Kachinsky...

417
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,600
他要在咱们的餐厅求婚吗
He's proposing at the diner?

418
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:21,920
他要怎么求 用洋葱圈当戒指吗
What's he gonna do? Put an onion ring on it?

419
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:31,700
我爱这戒指
I love that.

420
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:40,860
我本来打算拒绝你
You know, I was planning on saying no

421
00:20:40,860 --> 00:20:43,760
让你多求我几个小时 但...
and making you beg for a few hours, but...

422
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:47,420
我太爱你了
I just love you too much.

423
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:56,000
这画面没有平时那么恶心嘛
Aw, that's so not as gross as normal.

424
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:03,840
现在有了
Now it is.
